  "private": true,
  "description": "Portfolio website and profile repository for Abhijeet Kumar Prajapati. Static, dependency-free, no build step.",
  "author": "Abhijeet Kumar Prajapati",
  "license": "UNLICENSED",
  "homepage": "https://abhijeet-kumar-prajapati.github.io/Abhijeet-Kumar-Prajapati/",
  "repository": {
